message: "To cite the collection, use the citation below. For an individual research draft, use its Wentao Li entry in citations.bib, which links to the cited version."
title: "Mathematical research notes"
authors:
  - given-names: Wentao
    family-names: Li
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted research by Wentao Li on open problems in mathematics and theoretical
  computer science. Each draft provides a proposed proof or counterexample, a
  versioned citation and the original question source. Independent mathematical
  review and priority review are pending.
keywords:
  - open problems
  - AI-assisted mathematical research
  - mathematical conjectures
  - theoretical computer science
  - Busy Beaver functions
  - computability theory
  - set theory
  - finite model theory
  - learning theory
  - language generation
  - combinatorics
repository-code: "https://github.com/VictorLiwentao/solved-problems"
license: Apache-2.0
